    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55619" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταχορηγέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lauish as</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορηγός, ὑπέρ τινος πεντακισχιλίας
					δραχμάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					19.42
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>spend</i> or <i>contribute lavishly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσίας τισί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.72
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ οἰκεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; <i>squander upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι εἰς δεῖπνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eum.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ θέατρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.348f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοῖς στρατεύμασιν ἀφειδῶς τῶν
					χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
